{"title": "Disintegrating Corpse (Condition)", "pageid": 30914, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Disintegrating_Corpse_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Disintegrate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Disintegrate_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Disintegrate_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Disintegrate_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Disintegrate_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Disintegrate_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disintegrate Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Disintegrate_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Disintegrate_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Disintegrate_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Disintegrating Corpse</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>This corpse is not long for this world.\n</p>\n<ul><li>The affected entity's corpse disintegrates into a pile of ash upon death. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CORPSE_SWITCH</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCORPSE_SWITCH%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CCORPSE_SWITCH%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ApplyToDead\" title=\"Status properties/ApplyToDead\">ApplyToDead</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/IgnoreResting\" title=\"Status properties/IgnoreResting\">IgnoreResting</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Affects certain enemies, often those that are otherworldly or originate from outside the Prime Material Plane. Includes:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Merregon_Legionnaire\" title=\"Merregon Legionnaire\">Merregon Legionnaire</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Hellsboar\" title=\"Hellsboar\">Hellsboar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Wraith\" title=\"Wraith\">Wraiths</a> including <a href=\"/wiki/Mummy\" title=\"Mummy\">Mummy</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Daddy\" title=\"Daddy\">Daddy</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Poltergeist\" title=\"Poltergeist\">Poltergeist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Myrmidon\" title=\"Myrmidon\">Myrmidon</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>Prevents the use of affected entity's corpse for spells like <a href=\"/wiki/Animate_Dead\" title=\"Animate Dead\">Animate Dead</a>. Does not affect the loot dropped.</li>\n<li>Though it has a timed countdown beginning at 2 turns, the countdown will proceed in real-time regardless of Turn-Based Mode being active.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202655\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 988/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11140/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3967/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 978763/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.156      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   40.156      1 -total\n 48.48%   19.466      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 19.81%    7.955      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 16.64%    6.683      3 Template:Template_style\n 12.20%    4.898     12 Template:Trim\n 10.80%    4.337      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.15%    4.076      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.92%    3.984      2 Template:Icon_text\n  9.25%    3.716      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30914-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202655 and revision id 342023. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}